#: ../../assemblies.rst:56
msgid ""
"Each assembly carries gene models, cytobands, chromosome sizes and the "
"primary chromosome order used by the overview panel."
msgstr "每个装配都带基因模型、细胞遗传带、染色体长度，以及总览面板使用的主染色体顺序。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:60
msgid "How sequence is fetched"
msgstr "序列怎么取"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:62
msgid ""
"Every assembly in ``data/catalog.json`` records a ``twoBitURL`` pointing at "
"the UCSC 2bit file. When you navigate, Orbit issues an HTTP Range request "
"for just the bytes covering the window and decodes them locally."
msgstr ""
"``data/catalog.json`` 里每个装配都记录了一个指向 UCSC 2bit 文件的 ``twoBitURL``。导航时 Orbit "
"只对窗口覆盖的字节发 HTTP Range 请求，在本地解码。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:66
msgid "First visit to a chromosome: about one second"
msgstr "首次访问某条染色体：约 1 秒"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:67
msgid "Subsequent moves within it: about 0.3 seconds"
msgstr "之后在其上移动：约 0.3 秒"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:68
msgid ""
"Nothing is written to disk; the range cache is in memory and per session"
msgstr "不写磁盘；Range 缓存在内存里，随会话结束而消失"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:70
msgid ""
"If the network is unavailable, the sequence and GC tracks go grey and "
"everything else keeps working."
msgstr "网络不可用时，序列和 GC 轨道变灰，其余功能照常。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:74
msgid "Offline mode"
msgstr "离线模式"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:76
msgid ""
"Set ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` before launching to forbid network access. Combined "
"with a local FASTA or 2bit, this gives a fully air-gapped browser::"
msgstr "启动前设置 ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` 即可禁止联网。配合本地 FASTA 或 2bit，就是一个完全隔离的浏览器："

#: ../../assemblies.rst:82
msgid ""
"With no local sequence the GC and sequence tracks stay disabled, but genes, "
"cytobands, search and imported tracks are unaffected."
msgstr "没有本地序列时，GC 和序列轨道保持禁用，但基因、细胞遗传带、搜索和导入的轨道不受影响。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:86
msgid "Adding your own assembly"
msgstr "添加自己的装配"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:88
msgid ""
"Edit ``data/catalog.json`` and add an entry alongside the existing ones:"
msgstr "编辑 ``data/catalog.json``，在现有条目旁边加一条："

#: ../../assemblies.rst:102
msgid ""
"Then place ``genes.igvbin`` and ``cytoband.json`` under "
"``data/ann/myAssembly/``. The binary index is produced by the build scripts "
"in ``build/``; see :doc:`how-it-works` for the format."
msgstr ""
"然后把 ``genes.igvbin`` 和 ``cytoband.json`` 放到 ``data/ann/myAssembly/`` "
"下。二进制索引由 ``build/`` 里的构建脚本生成；格式见 :doc:`how-it-works`。"

#: ../../assemblies.rst:106
msgid ""
"Restart Orbit and the assembly appears in the selector. Nothing else needs "
"to change — the frontend reads the catalog, not a hard-coded list."
msgstr "重启 Orbit，装配就会出现在选择器里。其它都不用改——前端读的是 catalog，不是硬编码列表。"
